<main class="cmp-wrap">
    <h1 class="cmp-title">COMPARAR <span style="-webkit-text-stroke:2px #8b5cf6;color:transparent">PLAYBOOKS</span></h1>
    <p class="cmp-sub">Escolha ate 3 playbooks para comparar — metricas da auditoria real dos pacotes (mesmo motor do painel KT WIRZADE).</p>

    <div class="cmp-controls" id="controls">
        <select class="cmp-select" id="sel-a"><option value="">— Playbook A —</option></select>
        <span class="cmp-vs">VS</span>
        <select class="cmp-select" id="sel-b"><option value="">— Playbook B —</option></select>
        <span class="cmp-vs">VS</span>
        <select class="cmp-select" id="sel-c"><option value="">— Playbook C (opcional) —</option></select>
        <button class="cmp-btn" id="btn-go"><i class="fas fa-scale-balanced"></i> Comparar</button>
        <button class="cmp-btn" id="btn-best" style="background:none;border:1px solid var(--bdr2);color:var(--pl)"><i class="fas fa-crown"></i> Melhor p/ gaming</button>
    </div>

    <div class="cmp-grid" id="cards"></div>
    <div id="table-zone"></div>
    <div class="cmp-empty" id="empty-state"><i class="fas fa-scale-balanced" style="font-size:38px;margin-bottom:14px;display:block;color:var(--pd)"></i>Selecione acima e clique em Comparar.<br>Dica: o botao coroa escolhe automaticamente os melhores para gaming.</div>
</main>

